<title>JAPAN: Japan May secondary aluminium output rises 9.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Japan May secondary aluminium output rises 9.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's output and shipments of secondary aluminium and alloy rose in May from the same month a year earlier, the Japan Aluminium Alloy Refiners Association said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The data was as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>				  May 1997     yr/yr change</p>
<p> Output			  80,635	  +9.5 pct</p>
<p> Shipments		     80,572	  +8.5 pct</p>
<p> Inventories at end-May    25,377	  +3.3 pct</p>
<p>--Tokyo Commodity Desk +81-3-3432-6179</p>
</text>
